## Wiki Core Direction

{{core_direction}}

Normal initialization records the confirmed wiki purpose here. Draft initialization marks this section incomplete; complete it before relying on strict validation or profile-aware ingest.

## Page Frontmatter

Required fields: `title`, `slug`, `created`, `updated`, `type`, `summary`, `aliases`, `tags`, `sources`, `confidence`, `contested`.

Profile-aware pages may also include optional `profiles` and `extraction_goal` fields.

Allowed page types: `concept`, `entity`, `comparison`, `query`, `note`, `source-summary`.

Allowed confidence values: `high`, `medium`, `low`, `unknown`.

## Raw Source Policy

Raw notes preserve source meaning. Do not silently rewrite source claims, replace prior raw notes, or delete raw source body text.

## Extraction Profiles

Profiles live under `profiles/*.json` and use schema `llm-wiki-extraction-profile-v1`. A profile controls what to extract, what to ignore, page types, granularity, evidence policy, conflict policy, output roots, required sections, and retrieval/eval expectations.
